  "result": "Fixed in `Context.__init__` (`src/click/core.py:392`). A subcommand's context inherited the parent's whole `default_map` instead of the entry for its own name, so `{'sub': {'n': 5}}` never reached `sub`. It now uses `parent.default_map.get(info_name)`.\n\nCheck with a group and a `sub` command that has `--n` (default 1):\n- `default_map={'sub': {'n': 5}}` now gives `5`.\n- `default_map={'n': 9}` still gives `1`, because the top-level key isn't the subcommand's.\n\nThe full test suite passes (1906 passed, 102 skipped, 1 xfailed). I didn't add a regression test.",
